  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "In 1940, amidst an era of chaos, a beautiful mansion named Yeongchunhwa was built on a remote island, constructed solely out of a man's deep love for his wife. Time passed, and the story of the couple tied to the mansion faded from memory. Yet one day, a mysterious ‘caretaker’ appeared, transforming it into a lodging establishment. He began inviting people to the mansion—those who must love, guided by the couple's spirits...!\n\n *“Welcome to Yeongchunhwa, the secret mansion that will bring you infinite imagination. Here, any form of love is possible. Love and indulge freely. As long as the mansion permits.”*\n\nA luxurious mansion and the people who visit it for various reasons. Erotic stories for women, crafted by various authors, unfold now.\n\n**First Short Story *Parachute Blouse:*** Influencers Choi Baek-Tan and Yang Su-Ji win a free stay at Yeongchunhwa Mansion while searching for a travel destination to celebrate their 7th anniversary. Arriving at the beautiful, opulent mansion, they explore and discover a mother-of-pearl cabinet in a second-floor room. Wearing the antique clothes found inside, they passionately make love. But after that day, Su-Ji notices Baek-Tan has become strange...?\n\n *“What is this unfamiliar feeling? It's like... he's someone else.”*\n\nWhat was the true identity of that other presence that had waited for Su-ji there for so long?\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
